@host = http://localhost:5227

### Queries: read side (no-tracking context, projected straight to responses)

GET {{host}}/authors

###
GET {{host}}/books?search=tolkien

###
GET {{host}}/books?availableOnly=true

###
GET {{host}}/members

###
GET {{host}}/loans/overdue

### Commands: write side (tracked context, domain rules)

POST {{host}}/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Terry",
  "lastName": "Pratchett",
  "birthYear": 1948
}

### Validation pipeline behavior -> 422
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "isbn": "123",
  "publishedYear": 1000,
  "authorId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "totalCopies": 0
}

### Borrow a book (paste ids from the queries above)
POST {{host}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": "<book-id>",
  "memberId": "<member-id>"
}

### Return a book
POST {{host}}/loans/<loan-id>/return
